  <sys:String x:Key="Recording.Guidance">Recording guidance</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Recording.Guide1">• Select a microphone and preset before starting.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Recording.Guide2">• Recordings contain the processed microphone signal with the current DSP settings.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Recording.Guide3">• Pausing writes no silence, and paused time is excluded from the duration.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Recording.Guide4">• If recording data is dropped, the disk could not keep up while processing continued.</sys:String>

